._*


### Windows template
# Windows thumbnail cache files
Thumbs.db
Thumbs.db:encryptable
ehthumbs.db
ehthumbs_vista.db
# Folder config file
[Dd]esktop.ini
# Windows shortcuts
*.lnk


### Gradle template
.gradle
**/build/
!src/**/build/
# Avoid ignoring Gradle wrapper
!gradle-wrapper.jar
!gradle-wrapper.properties


### Vim template
# Swap
[._]*.s[a-v][a-z]
[._]*.sw[a-p]
[._]s[a-rt-v][a-z]
[._]ss[a-gi-z]
[._]sw[a-p]
# Session
Session.vim
Sessionx.vim
# Persistent undo
[._]*.un~


